WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.368 --> 00:00:01.910
STEPHANIE WONG:
Today, we are talking

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:05.450
about diversity and inclusion,
a highly available storage

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.540
launch, and a frequently
requested training.

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.150
This is Stephanie Wong,
and welcome to "This Week

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.230
in Cloud," where we serve
you the lowest latency news.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.550
Diversity, equity,
and inclusion--

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.300
DEI-- are more than
just buzzwords.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.760
They are critical components
of workplace culture

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.720
that have real, tangible impacts
on your entire organization.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.940
Not only because it
enhances your ability

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.650
to be responsive to
users and customers,

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.670
but because it builds trust
and a sense of belonging

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.050
for your employees.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.450
Read our short
ebook to learn steps

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.270
you can take to build
DEI into your business,

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:46.600
along with insights from
our journey at Google Cloud.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.540
We recently announced
Filestore Enterprise,

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:52.840
a fully-managed, cloud-native
NFS solution that lets you

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.050
confidently deploy critical
file-based applications

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.720
in Google Cloud, backed
by a service level

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.580
agreement that delivers
99.99% regional availability.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.560
To get started with
Filestore Enterprise,

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.750
register for our
webinar, Explore

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.840
What's New with Google
Cloud Storage, on October 6,

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:14.950
and Google Cloud Next
INF206 breakout session,

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:18.280
where you'll hear from real
users about their modernization

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.580
journey.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.650
You asked for it
and we listened.

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:25.650
We're excited to announce the
Cloud Digital Leader learning

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.830
pathway, our first offering
for business professionals

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.600
that includes both
training and certification.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.120
The Cloud Digital
Leader learning

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:36.750
pathway is designed to skill
up individuals and teams that

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.270
work with technical
Google Cloud practitioners

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.210
so they can contribute to
strategic, cloud-related

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.500
business decisions.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.350
Check out the blog to
learn more and sign up.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.540
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.400
or see a full list,
then check out the link.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.500
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.670
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:58.380
We'll see you in the Cloud.

